{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TVB「綠葉王」戴耀明絕對是公認的超級「孝順仔」。自從爸爸病逝後，身為獨生子的他便與媽媽相依為命，將照顧母親的責任一力扛上膊頭。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"12_600.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026hTAUMQN4mH1786936579.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"12_600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">戴耀明的演技備受肯定，在內地更不乏發展機會，甚至曾在網劇中擔正做男主角。雖然北上發展的酬勞相當豐厚，但他坦言實在放不下年邁的母親。為了能留在媽媽身邊盡孝，他寧願放棄長駐內地賺大錢的機會，只接短期、點對點的工作，每次一完工就火速飛奔回港陪伴母親，孝心爆棚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 努力工作大半生，戴耀明日前終於向大家報喜，宣布成功「上車」做業主！他更在社交平台感性發文，將這份超級大禮獻給八十多歲的母親：「老母，呢件嘢對於我嚟講，係一件好貴、好貴嘅東西。但老土啲講，有今生無來世，如有下世都可能見唔返了。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dia_yiu_ming_1786765863_3964001541442503313_1593891869.heic\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026HrUoCaQqRP1786936579.heic\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dia_yiu_ming_1786765863_3964001541442503313_1593891869.heic\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dia_yiu_ming_1786765863_3964001548581366332_1593891869.heic\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20266s40uiJRAX1786936579.heic\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dia_yiu_ming_1786765863_3964001548581366332_1593891869.heic\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他憶述媽媽大半生人都只住過木屋區和舊公屋，更曾挨過戰爭住防空洞、食番薯葉的日子。雖然這份「做業主」的禮物來得有點遲，但他謙虛又實在地表示：「我唔夠叻，搵錢唔多，只能夠死慳死底才能掹到車邊。」這番腳踏實地的自白，令人相當動容。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 最令人感動的是，戴耀明在揀樓時花盡心思，特意為媽媽挑選了一個對正獅子山的單位。他對媽媽說：「舊屋你對咗獅子山咁多年，新屋照樣畀你對返獅子山。老土都要講，你份獅子山下不屈不撓嘅精神，好值得我學習。請笑納，祝身體健康、開心過每天。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">戴耀明這份極致的孝心，瞬間感動無數網民與圈中好友。帖文一出，袁偉豪、樊亦敏等藝人紛紛留言送上祝賀；大批網民亦洗版式激讚他是「超級孝順仔」，並齊齊祝願戴媽媽身體健康！</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"13_600.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20264jeUZqGzdM1786936580.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"13_600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T03:38:52.048188+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":617,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}